{"id":119925538689885,"name":"Steal Or Die [UPDATE!]","desc":"🔦Escape the monster,  steal loot — or BE the monster\n\nYou have minutes to loot the building. Something is hunting you the whole time.\n\n💰 STEAL — 31 items to grab, from phones to gold bars. The rarer the loot, the bigger the payout… and the slower you run.\n🚪 HIDE — closets, vents, barricaded doors. It hears your footsteps. It hears your voice.\n👹 OR BE THE MONSTER — play as the entity and hunt your friends.\n\n[VERSION 1.45]: MANY IMPROVEMENTS AND FIXES + FACILITY AND OFFICE MAP EXPANSIONS\n\n★ 4 maps: Facility, Office, American Dorm and Supermarket!\n★ 4 entities: The Locust, The Hollow and etc...\n★ Skill trees, upgrades and 10 rebirths\n★ Cases, skins, emotes and trading\n★ Rare events: FULL BLACKOUT, BLOODBATH, MALFUNCTION...\n★ Lobby basketball with 1v1s\n\n🥽 FULL VR SUPPORT — real hands, real crouching, real fear.\n📱 FULL PHONE & TABLET SUPPORT — custom touch controls built for mobile.\n🖥️ PC, of course.\n🎮 CONSOLE\n\nBring friends. Don't trust them.\n\n👍 Like and favourite for updates!","path":"/game/119925538689885-steal-or-die","slug":"119925538689885-steal-or-die","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d23fe87dcdfdbaa071ba085acdcad7359b7bf16aee6c1c5854f45b5ebaf54d68.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5ad88e9a065de5119ca79ca217d25401/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":7543,"visitor":3855428,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T11:28:56.091Z","creator":{"name":"Vantage Gameworks","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6ad4723d967d123b7d320356","title":"Best  Script","game":{"_id":"6ad3e3e2a1702c4fe2027daf","gameId":119925538689885,"name":"Steal Or Die [UPDATE!]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"119925538689885-steal-or-die","path":"/game/119925538689885-steal-or-die","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","orig